# miRge3.0 organism annotation libraries
# This file configures the miRge3.0 organism libraries data table.
# Each line is tab-separated with the following columns:
#   value  - a unique identifier (e.g., "nematode")
#   dbkey  - the genome build key (e.g., "ce10")
#   organism - the organism name as used by miRge3.0 -on (e.g., "nematode")
#   path   - the path to the organism library directory (parent of the organism folder)
#
# Example:
# nematode	ce10	nematode	/data/mirge3_Lib
